{"h":"caterpillar-womens-dryverse-6inch-waterproof-work-boot-p74066-dark-beige-soft-toe","t":"Caterpillar Women's Dryverse 6\" Waterproof Work Boot (P74066 - Dark Beige - Soft Toe)","b":"Caterpillar","c":"Work Boots & Shoes","d":"Details \n The Dryverse work boot puts a woman in control. This traditional and classic style is waterproof keeping you comfortable and dry in wet conditions. It also features durable details including cement construction, a poured PU midsole and a rubber outsole. It also has electrical hazard protection against open circuits up to 600 volts (in dry conditions). With slip hazards always a possibility, the T870 outsole will have you covered and keep you on your feet. The 6\u201d work boot was designed specifically for a woman, and tough enough for the long haul. \n- ASTM F2892-18 Electrical Hazard Protection rated to protect against open circuits up to 600 volts in dry conditions\n- Cement Construction for added durability\n- Waterproof Full Grain Leather or Nubuck Upper keeps feet dry and protected\n- Nylon Mesh Lining for added breathability and comfort\n- Nylex\u2122 Sock Liner wicks away moisture from the foot to keep it dry and comfortable\n- PU Foam Footbed for cushioned comfort\n- Poured PU Midsole for additional shock absorption\n- Nylon Shank delivers stability and support\n- T870 Outsole performs against oil and water, and is abrasion resistant\n- SRX Best-in-Class, Slip-resistant Rubber Outsole reduces the risk of slips and falls on low tractions surfaces\n- Imported","tags":["Women / Woman / Ladies / Lady / Dama / Mujer"],"imgs":["https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0466/0428/8151/products/CATW-P74066-030519-S17-032.jpg","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0466/0428/8151/products/CATW-P74066-030519-S17-000.jpg","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0466/0428/8151/products/CATW-P74066-030519-S17-180.jpg","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0466/0428/8151/products/CATW-P74066-030519-S17-270.jpg","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0466/042